This contract permits one new local default-Windows package check after the
independently reviewed reader repairs. It retains the old full command,
780-second bound including compilation, four case threads and four-GiB disk
floor. It does not authorize a server run, qualification, dependency change or
new performance hypothesis. V4 pins and its first red result remain immutable.

