Preflight requires exact sources, auxiliaries and target catalog; unchanged
wrapper bodies; no inherited fixture, observer, build or executable Git-config
overrides; and clean tracked/untracked source inputs. The coordinator retains
intent before preflight and preserves any refusal. Duplicate output labels,
source drift and unknown input bytes cannot dispatch. No filter, thread/bound
override, environment sanitization or automatic retry is offered.

## Decision and retention

A complete zero-failure package result within the original guard is required.
Timeout, incomplete targets, missing verdicts, source change or unexpected error
remain red. Do not splice focused/current/MSRV cohorts into that verdict, rerun
unchanged source to seek a pass, prewarm the full package as an unrecorded retry,
or extend the deadline. Existing build artifacts are not performance evidence.

Retain exact source/HEAD before and after, preflight/wrapper receipts, raw streams,
outer-refusal and cleanup output, complete target/case accounting and first
focused refusals. Expected-red controls are tests of refusal behavior, not a
waiver for package failures. No numeric cache-performance claim follows.

Even a green package leaves security audit policy, C74 composition/scope and
production original delivery, all-writer retirement, lifecycle, reconnection and
real enrollment as separate release gates.
